              <source src="http://download.enmasse.com/videos/tera/brawlerskills/Fight_1_short.webm" type="video/webm">
            </video>
          </a>
          <p>Brawlers use Punch and Counter to deal damage and block enemy attacks. <span>Skills: Punch and Counter</span></p>
        </div><!-- end of video -->

        <div class="video">
          <h1>Crowd Control</h1>
          <a id="trailerCrowd" class="trailer" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/embed/lz-Qx8vcfSQ" href="#">
