            </video>
          </a>
          <p>Brawlers have many ways to handle groups, including Provoke, Infuriate, and Ground Pounder. <span>Skills: Bull Rush and Jackhammer</span></p>
        </div><!-- end of video -->

        <div class="video">
          <h1>Lockdown Skills</h1>
          <a id="trailerLockdown" class="trailer" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/embed/mIYtn4Og6eY" href="#">
